.TH rune-term-ctl-handover 1
.SH NAME
\fBrune\-term\-ctl\-handover\fR \- Flip the running instance\*(Aqs handover on: its exit hands its shells to keepers.
.SH SYNOPSIS
rune\-term\-ctl handover [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Flip the running instance\*(Aqs handover on: its exit hands its shells to keepers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output machine\-readable JSON.
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fR\fI <PATH>\fR
Path to the control socket.
